<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1020', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', padding: '52px 60px 30px 60px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4D8DFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2.2 }}>06 · 方法 —— 各支臂</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8 }}>
        四支臂，各只改一个变量 —— 背后 962 条记录
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#24334C', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 22 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#93A8C2', letterSpacing: 1.2, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>每个数字都走同一条路</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 10 }}>
                {[
                    ['原始数据', '许可与 md5 留档'],
                    ['冻结划分', '官方索引，带哈希'],
                    ['一次一支臂', '同一批行、同一批种子'],
                    ['一次运行一条记录', 'R²、MAE、哈希'],
                    ['每格一个 Λ、每数据集一个 κ', '过对账闸门之后才聚合'],
                ].map(([head, sub], i) => (
                    <Box key={head} style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                        {i > 0 ? <svg width='30' height='20' viewBox='0 0 30 20' style={{ marginTop: 3, marginBottom: 3 }}>
                            <line x1='15' y1='0' x2='15' y2='11' stroke='#8FA3BC' strokeWidth='2' />
                            <polygon points='15,19 9,10 21,10' fill='#8FA3BC' />
                        </svg> : null}
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', padding: '8px 12px', background: i === 2 ? '#16233A' : '#111B2E', border: '1px solid ' + (i === 2 ? '#2F4A75' : '#24334C'), borderRadius: 5 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{head}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 1 }}>{sub}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 720 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#16233A', padding: '11px 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ width: 140, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>臂</Text>
                    <Text style={{ width: 470, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>它改了什么</Text>
                    <Text style={{ width: 110, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', textAlign: 'right' }}>运行数</Text>
                </Box>
                {[
                    ['A1 地板', '预测训练均值 —— 只作参照', '48', '#8FA3BC', '#A8B8CE'],
                    ['A2 单元', '205 个 RDKit 描述符 + 2048 位指纹 → XGBoost，调 30 次', '328', '#FFFFFF', '#FFFFFF'],
                    ['A3 链', 'chemprop 2.1.0 MPNN —— 官方超参，一次都没调', '538', '#4D8DFF', '#4D8DFF'],
                    ['A4 链', 'polyBERT 冻结编码 + 岭回归头（容量封顶）', '48', '#4D8DFF', '#4D8DFF'],
                    ['A5 链', '本应在固定架构下注入链输入', '0', '#FF6B6B', '#FF6B6B'],
                ].map(([arm, change, runs, nameColor, runColor]) => (
                    <Box key={arm} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', padding: '12px 14px', background: '#0E1728', borderBottom: '1px solid #1D2A40' }}>
                        <Text style={{ width: 140, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: nameColor }}>{arm}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ width: 470, fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{change}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ width: 110, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: runColor, textAlign: 'right' }}>{runs}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFB020', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                A5 是 0，因为它的输入在数据里不存在 —— 见第 13 页。它被记为「不可构造」，从不记为「没有增益」。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>
            写任何表之前先过 4,897 条溯源检查 —— 4,832 ok / 65 豁免 / 0 失败。
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>7 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
